SUMMARY:[MILL Senior Friday] Reducing your Risk Memory Loss
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for a day full of events for Seniors with 
 the MILL @ MPL! All events are free and open to the public. Registration is 
 recommended unless otherwise noted.\n\n\nCary Lopez\, Executive Director & 
 Co Founder of the Act Now Foundation\, will be teaching us on healthy 
 lifestyle choices we can implement to help lower our risk of developing 
 dementia.\n\nHOW TO REGISTER\nThis class is run by the MILL. Please 
 register for classes directly through their website here.\n\nFor questions 
 about MILL classes please call 973-744-3278.\n\nMILL @ MPL is made possible 
 through a partnership between the MILL\, Montclair Public Library and 
 Partners for Health.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Health & Wellness
UID:LibCal-10306-16678827
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16678827
END:VEVENT
