DESCRIPTION:<span><span><b>An Afternoon with Godly Play</b><br>You may hav
 e heard Father Jerry and Reverend Katherine talk about "Godly Play" during
  their sermons this summer. But what's it all about? Simply put\, it's an 
 approach to Sunday School that recognizes that children are born with an 
 innate spirituality and our role is to nurture it and provide them with th
 e language to express it. Want to learn more? Join us on Saturday\, Octobe
 r 10\, from 1 to 4 pm in the Lower Level of the church. </span></span>If 
 you have any questions\, please speak with Ms. Jane Eliasof or Father Jerr
 y.
