DESCRIPTION:You belong in science - and the Computational\, Natural\, and 
 Applied Sciences community needs what you bring!\n \nJoin CNAS for refres
 hments\, conversation\, and an opportunity to share your interests\, stre
 ngths\, goals\, and ideas.\n \nAdd your voice to our interactive “Science
  Needs What You Bring” wall and discover the many talents\, perspectives\
