DESCRIPTION:**Midday MeetUp - Piano Concert with Clint Edwards**   \n  \nA
  monthly gathering to make connections and learn together.  \n12:30pm Cate
 red Lunch (free)  \n1:15pm Featured Program   \n  \n**Cost:** FREE or Sugg
 ested Donation of $10 per person to offset costs. (Bill My Account is only
  open to Shomrei Members)  \n  \n**RSVP:** Required so we know how much fo
 od to buy.  \nhttps://shomrei.easyshul.com/events/6ab6a9eb1d6f8f00272d4371
   \n  \nWe are pleased to welcome back pianist\, composer\, and music lect
 urer\, Clint Edwards. Clint will perform pop songs\, light classical\, jaz
 z and Broadway tunes while providing commentary and historical insights. P
 lease come and enjoy lunch followed by a piano performance for our first M
 idday Meetup of the season.   \n  \n**About Clint Edwards**  \nClint Edwar
 ds is a composer\, arranger\, and pianist. His compositions and arrangemen
 ts have been performed around the world. He is the winner of the 2019 Broa
 dway World Award for Best Independent Album Release. As a pianist\, he reg
 ularly gives more than 350 performances a year in the NYC metropolitan are
 a. For more information please visit: https://calendar.google.com/calendar
 /u/0/www.ClintEdwardsMusic.com  \n  \n**\\***Members &amp\; PreSchool Fami
 lies should use their fob to access the building.  \n  \n**Mark your calen
 dar for** these additional_dates_for_Midday_MeetUp: https://shomrei.org/ca
 lendar/midday-meetup-calendar  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact Office   \noff
 ice@shomrei.org   \n  \n\\#middaymeetup\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T220620Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
