DESCRIPTION:Ever feel like picking up a matcha or a carabiner? You might b
 e feeling like performative lesbian! In honor of National Coming Out Day\
 , one of our E-Board members\, River\, has taken charge in hosting the Pe
 rformative Lesbian Competition. Students will dress up as the Tiktok Perf
 ormative Lesbian\, winners will receive prizes! The event is intended for
  members of the LGBTQ+ community to promote solidarity and unity. This wi
 ll be a fundraiser event. To join\, students are encouraged to pay "what 
 they can." All proceeds will be donated to the Trevor Project!\n\nHosted 
 by: Coalition for Collective Liberation\n\nAdditional Information can be 
 found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12800665
