DESCRIPTION:In recognition of October as Domestic Violence Awareness Month
 \, I would love the opportunity to collaborate with Greek Council on prog
 ramming focused on healthy relationships\, consent\, communication\, and 
 recognizing signs of unhealthy or abusive relationships. This program wou
 ld also provide students with information about resources available on ca
 mpus and in the surrounding community\, including confidential support an
 d reporting options. The goal would be to create an open\, supportive env
 ironment where students can learn practical tools for building healthy re
 lationships while becoming more aware of how to support themselves and ot
 hers.\n\nHosted by: Advocacy and Outreach\, Bloomfield Greek Council\n\nA
 dditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/e
 ngage/event/12861326
