DESCRIPTION:Our Gaming Hub workshops are a chance for faculty to spend tim
 e with experienced game designers and pick up practical ideas for bringin
 g participation\, play\, and immersion into their teaching. Each session 
 is hands‑on\, low‑key\, and focused on simple techniques you can adapt to
  your own courses. If you’re curious about how game design can spark new 
