SUMMARY:Tech Toolbox: Canva: Get Ahead on Greeting Cards
DESCRIPTION:Please note: Today's session will be held in the first floor 
 Conference Room.\n\n\nTech Toolbox is a free hands-on workshop series 
 focused on building real\, practical digital skills. Each session zeroes in 
 on a specific skill\, program\, or tool—from core computer skills and 
 file management to navigating software and online platforms you use every 
 day. Participants are encouraged to bring their own devices and follow 
 along\, so you'll leave each session having actually practiced what you 
 learned.\n\nAll experience levels are welcome\, and your instructor will be 
 there to walk you through everything step by step. Sessions are free and 
 open to the public.\n\nThis week's topic is: Canva: Get Ahead on Greeting 
 Cards
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Computers & Technology
UID:LibCal-10306-16825873
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16825873
END:VEVENT
