  breast cancer awareness and service. Attendees will learn about breast c
 ancer through an educational presentation and hear about the mission of A
 ngie's Angels Foundation before participating in the assembly of Baskets 
 of Hope for breast cancer patients and survivors. Throughout the event\, 
 donations of new\, unused comfort and self-care items will be collected t
 o include in each basket. Guests will also enjoy light refreshments\, mus
 ic\, and fellowship while making a meaningful impact on the lives of thos
 e affected by breast cancer.\n\nHosted by: Omega Phi Chi\n\nAdditional In
 formation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/
 12841417
