SUMMARY:MOVED TO OCT 18: Modern Calligraphy Workshop for Adults
DESCRIPTION:**This program has been rescheduled for October 18. Those 
 already registered will have an opportunity to keep their spots. We will 
 reopen registration for the new date if new spots become available.** 
 \n\nJoin The Spotted Canvas for a fun and relaxing Modern Calligraphy 
 Workshop designed for beginners. Participants will learn the fundamentals 
 of modern calligraphy\, including proper pen technique\, basic strokes\, 
 lettering\, and how to connect letters to create beautiful words and 
 phrases. Each participant will have the opportunity to practice their new 
 skills and create their own personalized calligraphy piece to take home and 
 enjoy.\n\nNo prior experience is necessary. All materials will be 
 provided.\n\nRegistration required.
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Craft
UID:LibCal-10341-17655536
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17655536
END:VEVENT
