SUMMARY:An Autumn Sicilian Dinner: Cooking Demo and Tasting NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nCelebrate Italian Heritage and Culture Month with an Autumn 
 Sicilian Dinner.\n\nJoin Donna Liotto-Scocozza of Firenze International 
 Olive Oils for an Italian-inspired menu filled with bold flavors\, 
 comforting classics and a touch of nostalgia. The menu includes a colorful 
 Sicilian Olive Salad\; Chicken and Sausage Cacciatore\, a rustic braise 
 with tomatoes\, peppers and herbs\, served over crispy-outside\, 
 creamy-inside PanGrilled Polenta. Chocolate-Swirl Biscuit Tortoni\, a 
 cool\, creamy Italian-American favorite will complete the menu. Along the 
 way\, Donna will talk about ingredients\, techniques\, and simple ways to 
 bring the generous spirit of the Italian table into your own kitchen.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Culinary
UID:LibCal-10306-17211281
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17211281
END:VEVENT
