DESCRIPTION:Future authors of Glen Ridge\, welcome to Youth Story 
 Board!\n\nYouth Story Board (YSB) is a 5-week creative writing workshop for 
 youth (grades 4-6) \, each session teaches specific storytelling skills\, 
 allows time for original writing\, and compiles students' favorite works 
 into the YSB Literary Magazine.\n\nGrades 4-6 | Registration 
 Required*\n*Glen Ridge patrons ONLY\n\nWorkshop Dates: 10/15\, 10/ 29\, 
 11/12\, 12/3 & 12/17
