UID:3erscd5vt2nlh48n62sejhaal0@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260805T155151Z
DESCRIPTION:All Saints' Day is a day on which we pray the names of thos
 e we have lost in the past year (or longer). We are reminded of all those 
 who have marked our lives with a sign\, act\, word\,experience from their 
 own. We are ALL called to be saints to each other!\nIf you would like som
 eone remembered in our prayers on Sunday\, November 1\, please email (mai
 lto:office@holyspiritverona.org?subject=Names%20For%20All%20Saints%20Day)
  our Parish Administrator\, Catherine Tamasik (office@holyspiritverona.or
 g (mailto:office@holyspiritverona.org))\,or write the person(s) name(s) on
  the sheet in the Fellowship Hall.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T155151Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
END:VEVENT
