UID:51ttjtrfvvif8egqvlags11h3u_R20240908T130000@google.com__20261108
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20221110T035625Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Our</span><b><b> Choir sings most Sundays </b></b><span>
 during the 10am service.</span><i><i>  Are you a singer?  Do you like to
  sing? <span> </span></i></i><span>Consider joining us for<span> </span>
