SUMMARY:Concert: An Afternoon of Klezmer
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T180000
DTSTAMP:20261010T010314Z
UID:TU2167281732
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T160000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260911T204122Z
DESCRIPTION:**An Afternoon of Klezmer**  \nJoin us for a Sunday afternoon 
 of listening\, dancing\, and rejoicing with the Isle of Klezbos. Described
  by New York Magazine as “cutting-edge Klezmer\," this powerhouse sextet
  brings a beautiful balance of tradition and modern flair. Their music spa
 ns a variety of styles from neo-traditional folk dance and Yiddish swing t
 o unexpected rhythms like reggae\, retro tango\, and Latin grooves. Specia
 l guest Michael Winograd\, the renowned Klezmer clarinetist\, joins the ba
