SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Story Time (All Ages)
DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving Story Time with Nutley Family Services 
 Bureau\n\nFriday\, November 13 at 10:30 AM\n\nJoin us for a special story 
 time featuring tales of gratitude and a fall craft you can take home! 
 \n\nFor all ages. \n\nNo registration required. \n\nPlease consider 
 donating a non-perishable food item to the Food Pantry of the Nutley Family 
 Services Bureau. A collection box will be available in the Children's Room. 
 \n\nFor more information\, please visit nutleypubliclibrary.org or call the 
