 all of them are suitable for playing inside the library. Join us for the 
 one day where we break the rules and play a variety of games suitable for 
 ages 3 .\n\nSome of the games we have on offer include:\n\n\n	Don't Break 
 the Ice (3 )\n	Table Tennis (all ages)\n	Nok Hockey (all ages)\n	Perfection 
 (4 )\n	Operation (6 )\n	Trouble (4 )\n	Giant Connect 4 (6 )\n	Spot It: 
 Dinosaurs (4 )\n	Jenga (6 )\n\n\nWhen registering\, please make sure to 
 include the ages of all parties. This event is geared towards children\, 
 but caretakers and families are encouraged to join in.
