SUMMARY:Mindfulness in the Garden
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261124T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261124T103000
UID:tribe-10007860@montclairfoundation.org
DESCRIPTION:Mindfulness in the GardenTuesdays\, 9:30 AM – 10:30 AM (NEW 
 TIME)September Series: 9/8\, 15\, 22\, 29October Series: 10/6 13\, 20\, 27
 November Series: 11/3\, 10\, 17\, 24.Instructor:Jodi BrooksDiscover how a 
 mindfulness practice can help us awaken and live in harmony with oneself a
 nd with the natural world. This class will include: simple instructions fo
 r getting started with a formal mindfulness practice\, very gentle stretch
