UID:tribe-18761@montclairfoundation.org
DESCRIPTION:December 1 & 2 at 7 PMThe PrecipiceOur fall season concludes w
 ith two performances ofThe Precipice\, written by Montclair’s own songwr
 iter\, storyteller\, and singerMiranda Ferriss Jones. Jones will take the 
 stage with fellow Montclair resident and Tony Award-winning Broadway starL
 aura Benanti\, alongside an exciting ensemble of theatrical talent. Create
 d by Ferris Jones\, The Precipice is an original musical exploring sisterh
 ood\, identity\, and the wildness we carry within us.$45 MEMBER ADMISSION 
 | $
LOCATION:Van Vleck House &#038\; Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/cultural-arts-series-the-precipi
 ce-2/
