SUMMARY:Cozy Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Nutley Public Library's evening book club for adults\, to be 
 held monthly in person. Zoom link provided if requested.\n\nJuly book club 
 pick to be announced. Copies will be available for pick up from the library 
 for all registrants.\n\nRegistration will open at 9:00 am on Tuesday\, June 
 15th. Limited to 20 Nutley adult cardholders.
